            <ArticleTitle>[Pharmacological studies on the Chinese drug radix Angelicae dahuricae].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>560-2, 576</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Several species of the Chinese drug Angelica dahurica from different habitats have been studied in terms of anti-inflammatory, analgesic and antipyretic actions and acute toxicity. The medical value of these species is reported in this paper as a guideline for their clinic application.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
